      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/ihris/ihris-common/ns#glossary/code-list-currency",
      "@type": "skos:ConceptScheme",
      "skos:prefLabel": "iHRIS 4.3.3 code list: currency",
      "skos:definition": "The `currency` code list as iHRIS 4.3.3 ships it by default: 162 codes from ihris-common/module/iso-currency. Each term's notation is the iHRIS record id and its label the record's `name`. The source gives no definitions, so every term is a candidate. The 4 sample record(s) illustrate one example deployment and are left out. 143 term(s) link to EU Publications Office authority table: currencies, from the verified ConceptMap currency-to-iso-4217 (equal only); the IRIs follow the publisher's pattern and were not dereferenced.",
      "dcterms:hasVersion": "4.3.3",
      "dcterms:source": "src/ihris-common/data-lists/4.3.3/currency.json (iHRIS 4.3.3, MD5-verified release)",
